                                "sense_id": "ec2be15a-2b1d-3b22-81ad-ccff34bc9698",
                                "text": "When our minds shall perceive what a pure imitation of God its life is, and how exactly deiform all its motions and actions are, with what ravishing pleasure will they even review their own motions […]"
